# The Hackl in Bad Ischl (D-097; no H-box in the stage, she brings it):
# the real flow on the test route hackl -> bad_ischl (as in
# flow_hackl_carry_over): the hackl run to its Maibaum, the route map, the
# Bad Ischl intro, then play as Hackl. Resi waits behind the garden wall
# until the pigeon has left the Kaiser's hat, crosses the statue and throws
# an axe at Kurgast #1 walking ahead of her: Defeat, 100 (6850 -> 6950).
# On the Kaiserpark terrace she drops onto the avenue behind file A and
# throws at the rear officer in his march: Defeat, 200 and „Abtreten!"
# (7550 -> 7750 after the terrace Oblaten). No hurt, still Hackl. The
# route's second station is St. Gilgen's slot (`stage=` names the station).
level  = hackl
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
route  = hackl bad_ischl
expect = deaths=0 no_event=Hurt event=HacklThrown event=AxeHit score=7750
expect = state=playing stage=st_gilgen power=hackl
